content:
Here are the domain objects:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Sales Consultant",
      "description": "Employee who guides customers through selecting and evaluating vehicles"
    },
    {
      "name": "Vehicle",
      "description": "Car available for viewing, test driving, or purchase"
    },
    {
      "name": "Test Drive",
      "description": "Customer trial of a vehicle before deciding on a purchase"
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "description": "Person interested in browsing, evaluating, or purchasing a vehicle"
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback",
      "description": "Customer impressions about a vehicle or test drive"
    },
    {
      "name": "Finance Officer",
      "description": "Staff member who reviews financing eligibility and prepares agreements"
    },
    {
      "name": "Credit Application",
      "description": "Customer submission used to evaluate financing options"
    },
    {
      "name": "Car Purchase",
      "description": "Transaction record for buying a vehicle including financing details"
    },
    {
      "name": "Financing Option",
      "description": "Proposed loan terms available to a customer"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lease Agreement",
      "description": "Contract outlining terms for leasing a vehicle"
    },
    {
      "name": "Inventory Manager",
      "description": "Employee who tracks vehicle availability and manages stock levels"
    },
    {
      "name": "Manufacturing Order",
      "description": "Order request for new vehicles sent to a manufacturer"
    },
    {
      "name": "Manufacturer",
      "description": "External vehicle producer receiving inventory orders"
    }
  ]
}
```

Help me find the associations.  

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name each object and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

Here are the associations:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "Inventory Manager",
      "to": "Manufacturing Order",
      "description": "Inventory Manager creates a Manufacturing Order to request new vehicles"
    },
    {
      "from": "Manufacturing Order",
      "to": "Manufacturer",
      "description": "Manufacturing Order is sent to the Manufacturer for processing"
    },
    {
      "from": "Inventory Manager",
      "to": "Vehicle",
      "description": "Inventory Manager tracks each Vehicle in the lot"
    },
    {
      "from": "Customer",
      "to": "Credit Application",
      "description": "Customer submits a Credit Application for financing review"
    },
    {
      "from": "Sales Consultant",
      "to": "Vehicle",
      "description": "Sales Consultant presents a Vehicle to assist customer decisions"
    },
    {
      "from": "Customer",
      "to": "Test Drive",
      "description": "Customer participates in a Test Drive to evaluate a vehicle"
    },
    {
      "from": "Test Drive",
      "to": "Vehicle",
      "description": "Test Drive uses a specific Vehicle for evaluation"
    },
    {
      "from": "Sales Consultant",
      "to": "Test Drive",
      "description": "Sales Consultant arranges the Test Drive for the customer"
    },
    {
      "from": "Customer",
      "to": "Feedback",
      "description": "Customer provides Feedback based on their sales experience"
    },
    {
      "from": "Feedback",
      "to": "Sales Consultant",
      "description": "Feedback is directed to the Sales Consultant for service improvement"
    },
    {
      "from": "Customer",
      "to": "Car Purchase",
      "description": "Customer initiates a Car Purchase to acquire a vehicle"
    },
    {
      "from": "Car Purchase",
      "to": "Vehicle",
      "description": "Car Purchase is tied to the Vehicle being bought"
    },
    {
      "from": "Finance Officer",
      "to": "Car Purchase",
      "description": "Finance Officer prepares documentation for the Car Purchase"
    },
    {
      "from": "Finance Officer",
      "to": "Credit Application",
      "description": "Finance Officer evaluates the Credit Application for approval"
    }
  ]
}
```
